        "cultural_importance": "",
        "desc": "<span>1. <b>Ziziphus mauritiana</b> Lam., Encycl. Meth. Bot.  3:318.  1789.  DC., Prodr. 2:21. 1825; Collett, l.c. 90; R.R. Stewart, l.c. 469; Browicz 1.c. 8.  <P>M. QAISER AND S. NAZIMUDDIN<P><P><p><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250075385' TITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ziziphus</i> <i>jujuba*</i>  Lam.</A><p>Tree, 9-15 m or large shrub, branches spreading and drooping, young branches softly tomentose, longer stipular spine, c. 5-7 mm long, sometime without spines. Leaves ovate, oblong, elliptic-ovate, or sub-orbicular, 2-9 cm x 1.5-5 cm, slightly oblique at base, obtuse, rounded shortly acuminate at apex, rounded or sub-cordate or entire, serrate, glabrous and dark green above, greyish pale-coloured and densely tomentose beneath; petiole 8-15 mm long, tomentose. Inflorescence axillary cymes, tomentose. Flowers 2-3 mm across, greenish yellow. Calyx 5, hairy out-side, glabrous within, c. 1.5 mm long, ovate, acute, keeled within. Petals 5, spoon like or clawed, reflexed, c.1 mm long. Stamens 5, smaller than the petals. Ovary 2-celled, styles bifid. Disc 10-lobed or grooved; fruit 1.5-3.5 x 1.5-2.5 cm, globose to ovoid, bilocular; pyrene tubercled and irregularly furrowed.<p><p><p><p>Distribution: India, Pakistan, Afghanistan, Ceylon, China, Australia, Trop. Africa. <p><p><p><p><P></span>                        <P><!-- Key -->                        <div id=\"panelKey\">                          <BR clear=\"all\">                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\"><tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\"><TD width=\"347\">                                <P>                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>                              </TD><TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">                                <P>                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>                              </TD></tr><tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\"><TD colspan=\"2\">                                <P>                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>                                <P>                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' ><TR >  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plant cultivated, medium sized tree, leaves 6-9 cm long. Fruit ovoid,2.5-3.5 cm long</td>  <td >&nbsp;</td>  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250075382'  TARGET='_top' >Ziziphus mauritiana var. mauritiana</A></td></TR><TR >  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plant wild mostly large shrub, leaves 2-3 cm long. Fruit globose, 1-1.5 cm long</td>  <td >&nbsp;</td>  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250075383'  TARGET='_top' >Ziziphus mauritiana var. spontanea</A></td></TR></TABLE></span></P>                              </TD></tr><tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\"><TD colspan=\"2\">                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD></tr></table>                        "
