        "cultural_importance": "",
        "desc": "<span>1. <b>Calotropis procera</b> (Ait.) Ait. f., Hort. Kew ed.  2.2: 78.  1811.  Ali in Notes RBG Edinb. 38(2):287-290. 1980.  <P><P><P><p><p><p><p><p><p><p><p><p><p><P></span>                        <P><!-- Key -->                        </P>                         <P>                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p><br><ul><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250077161' TITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Calotropis</b> <b>procera</b> subsp. <b>hamiltonii</b>  (Wight) Ali</A></ul><p><p><br><ul><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250077162' TITLE='Synonym' ><i>Calotropis</i> <i>hamiltonii</i>  Wight = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250077161' TITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Calotropis</b> <b>procera</b> subsp. <b>hamiltonii</b>  (Wight) Ali</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250077163' TITLE='Synonym' ><i>Calotropis</i> <i>procera*</i>  auct. non (Ait.) Ait. f.: Hook. f. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250077161' TITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Calotropis</b> <b>procera</b> subsp. <b>hamiltonii</b>  (Wight) Ali</A></A></ul><p></span></P>                        <BR clear=\"all\">                        <P>&nbsp;</P>                                                <P></P>                      "
